# Rebound's cast is a cast like any other (CR 702.88a, 601.2c), so a card with no legal target cannot be cast and
# simply stays in exile - the 2019-06-14 ruling: "If you choose not to cast the card, or if you can't (perhaps because
# there are no legal targets available), the card will stay exiled. You won't get another chance to cast it on a
# future turn." Bot1 blinks Thraben Inspector on turn 3; Bot2 bolts the Inspector on turn 4; at Bot1's turn 5 upkeep
# Bot1 controls no creature, nothing is offered, and Ephemerate stays in exile on turn 7 too.

